## Title: cChat
## Description: Console-friendly chat enhancement addon that adds timestamps and chat history restoration. Designed for gamepad UI compatibility. LibAsync is recommended for performance but not needed. Based on rChat by Shadowfen.
## Version: 1.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 2
## Author: tzammy_
## APIVersion: 101050
## SavedVariables: CCHAT_SETTINGS CCHAT_HISTORY
## DependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0
## OptionalDependsOn: LibAsync

cChat_Global.lua
cChat_Timestamps.lua
cChat_History.lua
cChat.lua
cChat_Settings.lua
